#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:4
msgid "v5.0.1"
msgstr "v5.0.1"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v5.0.1 is a maintenance release on top of v5.0.0 — the legacy ``sensor`` "
"module becomes a Python compatibility layer over :mod:`csi`, images loaded "
"into the frame buffer now preview like camera frames, the JPEG encoders lose"
" their 1 MB output limit and handle overflow correctly, and there is a batch"
" of camera, protocol, networking, and ML-library fixes. It introduces **no "
"breaking API changes** for scripts written against :mod:`csi`; the handful "
"of behavior changes are listed under :ref:`breaking API changes "
"<v5_0_1_breaking>`."
msgstr ""
"v5.0.1 是基于 v5.0.0 的维护版本——旧的 ``sensor`` 模块变为构建于 :mod:`csi` 之上的 Python "
"兼容层，加载到帧缓冲区中的图像现在会像摄像头帧一样预览，JPEG 编码器不再有 1 MB "
"的输出限制并能正确处理溢出，此外还有一批针对摄像头、协议、网络和机器学习库的修复。对于基于 :mod:`csi` 编写的脚本，它\\ "
"**不引入任何破坏性 API 变更**\\ ；少数几处行为变更列在 :ref:`破坏性 API 变更 <v5_0_1_breaking>` 之下。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:22
msgid ""
"**The** ``sensor`` **module is now a frozen Python module** built on "
":mod:`csi`. It prints a deprecation warning on import; a few functions the "
":mod:`csi` module cannot support now raise ``OSError``. See :ref:`the sensor"
" module changes <v5_0_1_s1>`."
msgstr ""
"``sensor`` **模块现在是一个固化的 Python 模块**\\ ，构建于 :mod:`csi` 之上。导入时会打印弃用警告；少数几个 "
":mod:`csi` 模块无法支持的函数现在会引发 ``OSError``\\ 。参见 :ref:`sensor 模块变更 <v5_0_1_s1>`\\"
" 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Loaded images preview like camera frames.** An image placed in the frame "
"buffer with ``copy_to_fb=True`` (:class:`image.Image`, "
":meth:`image.ImageIO.read`, :func:`fir.snapshot`, :func:`tof.snapshot`) is "
"flushed to the IDE — with anything drawn on it — when the next image "
"overwrites the frame buffer, instead of immediately. See :ref:`the preview "
"changes <v5_0_1_s2>`."
msgstr ""
"**加载的图像像摄像头帧一样预览。** 通过 ``copy_to_fb=True`` 放入帧缓冲区的图像（\\ "
":class:`image.Image`\\ 、\\ :meth:`image.ImageIO.read`\\ 、\\ "
":func:`fir.snapshot`\\ 、\\ :func:`tof.snapshot`\\ "
"）会在下一张图像覆盖帧缓冲区时——连同绘制在其上的任何内容——被刷出到 IDE，而不是立即刷出。参见 :ref:`预览变更 <v5_0_1_s2>`\\"
" 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:32
msgid ""
"**JPEG encoder overhaul.** The 1 MB output-buffer cap is gone (the buffer is"
" sized from free memory), overflow on both the software and hardware paths "
"is handled instead of writing truncated files, and saving a compressed image"
" under the other compressed extension raises instead of writing garbage."
msgstr ""
"**JPEG 编码器全面改造。** 1 MB "
"的输出缓冲区上限已取消（缓冲区大小根据可用内存确定），软件和硬件路径上的溢出都会得到处理而不再写出截断的文件，并且将已压缩图像以另一种压缩格式的扩展名保存时会引发异常，而不再写出垃圾数据。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:36
msgid ""
"**New** :func:`protocol.poll` and **six new CBOR widgets** (``text``, "
"``lineedit``, ``pushbutton``, ``spinbox``, ``radio``, ``waveform``) for "
":class:`protocol.CBORChannel`."
msgstr ""
"**新增** :func:`protocol.poll`\\ ，并为 :class:`protocol.CBORChannel` **新增六种 CBOR"
" 控件**\\ （\\ ``text``\\ 、\\ ``lineedit``\\ 、\\ ``pushbutton``\\ 、\\ "
"``spinbox``\\ 、\\ ``radio``\\ 、\\ ``waveform``\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:39
msgid ""
"**YOLO Pro post-processor**, **FLIR Lepton 3.1R / UW** support, **IMU burst "
"reads**, **CAN on the OpenMV N6**, and a **networking-capable simulator** "
"target."
msgstr ""
"**YOLO Pro 后处理器**\\ 、\\ **FLIR Lepton 3.1R / UW** 支持、\\ **IMU 突发读取**\\ 、\\ "
"**OpenMV N6 上的 CAN**\\ ，以及一个\\ **支持网络的模拟器**\\ 目标。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:44
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:46
msgid ""
":class:`YoloPro <ml.postprocessing.edgeimpulse.YoloPro>` — a new post-"
"processor for Edge Impulse YOLO Pro object-detection models, plus a "
"``yolo_pro_detector.py`` example. (`f3f150ebd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f3f150ebd>`__, `ea7bbb398 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/ea7bbb398>`__)"
msgstr ""
":class:`YoloPro <ml.postprocessing.edgeimpulse.YoloPro>` —— 用于 Edge Impulse "
"YOLO Pro 目标检测模型的新后处理器，并附带 ``yolo_pro_detector.py`` 示例。（\\ `f3f150ebd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f3f150ebd>`__\\ 、\\ `ea7bbb398 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/ea7bbb398>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:51
msgid ""
":func:`protocol.poll` — run one iteration of the protocol task on demand, "
"for custom transports that are not driven by the USB interrupt or the "
"``poll_ms`` timer. :func:`protocol.init` can also be called again to re-"
"initialize the stack. (`c00c215f9 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c00c215f9>`__, `f849ffb1b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f849ffb1b>`__)"
msgstr ""
":func:`protocol.poll` —— 按需运行一次协议任务迭代，供不由 USB 中断或 ``poll_ms`` "
"定时器驱动的自定义传输层使用。也可以再次调用 :func:`protocol.init` 来重新初始化协议栈。（\\ `c00c215f9 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c00c215f9>`__\\ 、\\ `f849ffb1b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f849ffb1b>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:57
msgid ""
"**More CBOR channel widgets** — :meth:`protocol.CBORChannel.add` gains "
"``text`` (static string), ``lineedit`` (writable string), ``pushbutton`` "
"(momentary action), ``spinbox`` (stepped numeric entry), ``radio`` (option "
"group) and ``waveform`` (1D time-series with ``sample_rate``, ``series`` and"
" ``typecode`` arguments; assign interleaved sample bytes to stream it). "
"(`8016d29ba <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/8016d29ba>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**更多 CBOR 通道控件** —— :meth:`protocol.CBORChannel.add` 新增 ``text``\\ "
"（静态字符串）、\\ ``lineedit``\\ （可写字符串）、\\ ``pushbutton``\\ （瞬时动作）、\\ "
"``spinbox``\\ （步进式数值输入）、\\ ``radio``\\ （选项组）和 ``waveform``\\ （1D 时间序列，带 "
"``sample_rate``\\ 、\\ ``series`` 和 ``typecode`` 参数；赋值交错的采样字节即可流式发送）。（\\ "
"`8016d29ba <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/8016d29ba>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:63
msgid ""
":data:`csi.CUSTOM` — :meth:`csi.CSI.framesize` now returns a usable constant"
" after a custom ``(w, h)`` resolution has been set, instead of an anonymous "
"integer. (`af8841654 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/af8841654>`__)"
msgstr ""
":data:`csi.CUSTOM` —— 在设置了自定义 ``(w, h)`` 分辨率之后，\\ :meth:`csi.CSI.framesize` "
"现在返回一个可用的常量，而不是一个匿名整数。（\\ `af8841654 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/af8841654>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:67
msgid ""
"**IMU burst read** — :func:`imu.__read_reg` accepts an optional writable "
"buffer and fills it from consecutive registers in one transaction. "
"(`244ca480a <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/244ca480a>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**IMU 突发读取** —— :func:`imu.__read_reg` 接受一个可选的可写缓冲区，并在一次事务中用连续寄存器的内容填充它。（\\ "
"`244ca480a <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/244ca480a>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:70
msgid ""
"**FLIR Lepton 3.1R and Lepton UW** are recognized by the Lepton driver, "
"including their radiometric gain modes. (`0fc356632 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/0fc356632>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**FLIR Lepton 3.1R 和 Lepton UW** 现已被 Lepton 驱动识别，包括其辐射测量增益模式。（\\ `0fc356632 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/0fc356632>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:73
msgid ""
"**Simulator networking** — the ``MPS2_AN500`` QEMU target now has lwIP and a"
" user-mode NIC, with ``requests``, ``mqtt`` and ``sensor`` frozen in, and a "
"networking unit test. (`23546dfb1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/23546dfb1>`__, `61d187305 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/61d187305>`__, `15096c3a2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/15096c3a2>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**模拟器网络** —— ``MPS2_AN500`` QEMU 目标现在具备 lwIP 和用户模式网卡，固化了 ``requests``\\ 、\\ "
"``mqtt`` 和 ``sensor``\\ ，并新增了一个网络单元测试。（\\ `23546dfb1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/23546dfb1>`__\\ 、\\ `61d187305 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/61d187305>`__\\ 、\\ `15096c3a2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/15096c3a2>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:79
msgid ""
"**OpenAI-compatible API example** — ``openai_compatible.py`` snapshots a "
"JPEG and posts it to a chat-completions endpoint for scene description. "
"(`79033c6aa <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/79033c6aa>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**OpenAI 兼容 API 示例** —— ``openai_compatible.py`` 拍摄一张 JPEG 快照并将其发送到 chat-"
"completions 端点以进行场景描述。（\\ `79033c6aa "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/79033c6aa>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:82
msgid ""
"**SX126x LoRa examples** — micropython-lib's ``lora-sx126x`` driver (with "
"``lora-sync`` / ``lora-async``) is frozen into the OpenMV RT1062 firmware, "
"with sender/receiver/ping-pong/image-stream examples for wiring an SX1261 or"
" SX1262 module to the SPI bus. This is community-contributed support; OpenMV"
" does not sell LoRa hardware. (`19576e1b1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/19576e1b1>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**SX126x LoRa 示例** —— micropython-lib 的 ``lora-sx126x`` 驱动（连同 ``lora-sync`` "
"/ ``lora-async``\\ ）已固化进 OpenMV RT1062 固件，并附带发送端/接收端/乒乓/图像流示例，用于将 SX1261 或 "
"SX1262 模块接到 SPI 总线上。这是由社区贡献的支持；OpenMV 不销售 LoRa 硬件。（\\ `19576e1b1 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/19576e1b1>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:90
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他变更与改进"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:92
msgid ""
"``requests`` **library rewrite** — chunked transfer responses are decoded, a"
" ``timeout`` argument (default 5 s) is exposed, JSON and string bodies are "
"serialized/encoded correctly, headers are parsed case-insensitively and the "
"status line by position, the caller's ``headers`` dict is copied (so "
"``auth`` no longer leaks into later requests), and the body is read in "
"blocks into a ``bytearray``. (`889f0b096 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/889f0b096>`__)"
msgstr ""
"``requests`` **库重写** —— 分块传输响应会被解码，公开了 ``timeout`` 参数（默认 5 秒），JSON "
"和字符串请求体会被正确序列化/编码，响应头解析不区分大小写且状态行按位置解析，调用方的 ``headers`` 字典会被复制（因此 ``auth`` "
"不再泄漏到后续请求中），响应体则分块读入一个 ``bytearray``\\ 。（\\ `889f0b096 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/889f0b096>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:99
msgid ""
"``mqtt`` imports :mod:`ssl` lazily, so the module and plain (non-TLS) "
"connections work on builds without SSL support. (`c2e0899e8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c2e0899e8>`__)"
msgstr ""
"``mqtt`` 会延迟导入 :mod:`ssl`\\ ，因此该模块和普通（非 TLS）连接在不支持 SSL 的固件版本上也能工作。（\\ "
"`c2e0899e8 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c2e0899e8>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:102
msgid ""
"**JPEG output buffer sized from free memory** instead of a fixed 1 MB cap; "
"the encoders trim the buffer to the encoded size before the image is written"
" out, so large-sensor captures at high quality no longer fail. (`aa1ca6776 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/aa1ca6776>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**JPEG 输出缓冲区大小根据可用内存确定**\\ ，而不再是固定的 1 MB "
"上限；编码器会在图像写出之前将缓冲区裁剪到编码后的大小，因此大尺寸传感器的高质量拍摄不再失败。（\\ `aa1ca6776 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/aa1ca6776>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:106
msgid ""
"**ML post-processing cleanup** — bounding-box generation is standardized "
"across the Darknet, Edge Impulse and Ultralytics post-processors, and the "
"YOLOv8 output is transposed after thresholding so it is stored one row per "
"detection like the other models. (`b5c7853f2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b5c7853f2>`__, `c45f99cad "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c45f99cad>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**机器学习后处理清理** —— Darknet、Edge Impulse 和 Ultralytics 后处理器的边界框生成已统一，YOLOv8 "
"输出在阈值筛选后会被转置，从而像其他模型一样按每个检测结果一行来存储。（\\ `b5c7853f2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b5c7853f2>`__\\ 、\\ `c45f99cad "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c45f99cad>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:112
msgid ""
"**PAG7936 safe shutdown** — a new sensor halt flag puts the PAG7936 to sleep"
" before RESET/PWDN toggle, fixing lock-ups when the sensor is used on an "
"extension cable. The driver also selects its MIPI CSI-2 or parallel register"
" set from the sensor's I2C address at runtime instead of at build time. "
"(`10026530c <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/10026530c>`__, "
"`f6acf14ec <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f6acf14ec>`__, "
"`5f0251c74 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/5f0251c74>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**PAG7936 安全关机** —— 新的传感器停止标志会在切换 RESET/PWDN 之前让 PAG7936 "
"进入睡眠，修复了传感器通过延长线使用时的死锁问题。驱动还会在运行时（而非构建时）根据传感器的 I2C 地址选择 MIPI CSI-2 "
"或并行寄存器集。（\\ `10026530c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/10026530c>`__\\ 、\\ `f6acf14ec "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f6acf14ec>`__\\ 、\\ `5f0251c74 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/5f0251c74>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:120
msgid ""
"``ImageIO`` playback pacing now services pending events while waiting for "
"the inter-frame interval instead of sleeping in ``WFI``. (`a54790193 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a54790193>`__)"
msgstr ""
"``ImageIO`` 的回放节奏控制现在会在等待帧间间隔时处理待处理的事件，而不是在 ``WFI`` 中休眠。（\\ `a54790193 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a54790193>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:123
msgid ""
"**MicroPython submodule updates** — full networking support on the QEMU "
"port, ``machine.mem_backup`` on STM32 via backup SRAM/BKP registers, SDIO "
"hardware flow control kept disabled on STM32F4, and MPU attribute reuse for "
"non-cacheable regions. (`31ada5626 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/31ada5626>`__, `ab61d27a6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/ab61d27a6>`__, `06bddf13a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/06bddf13a>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**MicroPython 子模块更新** —— QEMU 移植版获得完整的网络支持，STM32 上通过备份 SRAM/BKP 寄存器实现 "
"``machine.mem_backup``\\ ，STM32F4 上保持禁用 SDIO 硬件流控，以及对不可缓存区域复用 MPU 属性。（\\ "
"`31ada5626 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/31ada5626>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`ab61d27a6 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/ab61d27a6>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`06bddf13a <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/06bddf13a>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:130
msgid ""
"``differential-translation.py`` captures through its :class:`csi.CSI` object"
" instead of the deprecated ``sensor`` module, and example import spacing was"
" normalized. (`68c866e7f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/68c866e7f>`__, `9ceff4513 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9ceff4513>`__)"
msgstr ""
"``differential-translation.py`` 现在通过其 :class:`csi.CSI` 对象采集图像，而不再使用已弃用的 "
"``sensor`` 模块；示例中的 import 间距也已统一。（\\ `68c866e7f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/68c866e7f>`__\\ 、\\ `9ceff4513 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9ceff4513>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:137
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "错误修复"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:139
msgid "Camera and sensors:"
msgstr "摄像头与传感器："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:141
msgid ""
"Setting two custom ``(w, h)`` resolutions in a row left the sensor at the "
"first size while :meth:`csi.CSI.width` / :meth:`~csi.CSI.height` reported "
"the second; the \"no change\" fast path now excludes custom sizes. "
"(`cfbb70156 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/cfbb70156>`__)"
msgstr ""
"连续设置两个自定义 ``(w, h)`` 分辨率会让传感器停留在第一个尺寸，而 :meth:`csi.CSI.width` / "
":meth:`~csi.CSI.height` 却报告第二个尺寸；“无变化”快速路径现在会排除自定义尺寸。（\\ `cfbb70156 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/cfbb70156>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:145
msgid ""
":meth:`csi.CSI.lens_correction` parsed ``radi`` and ``coef`` as booleans, so"
" the values passed to the driver were not the ones given. (`ab44b3a77 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/ab44b3a77>`__)"
msgstr ""
":meth:`csi.CSI.lens_correction` 曾将 ``radi`` 和 ``coef`` "
"解析为布尔值，导致传给驱动的值并非所给定的值。（\\ `ab44b3a77 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/ab44b3a77>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:148
msgid ""
"PAG7936: setting exposure and gain back-to-back clobbered each other (both "
"share one manual mode and the read-back registers lag a frame); the driver "
"now seeds the manual registers only when entering manual mode and writes "
"just the control being set. (`e7a18c0a0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e7a18c0a0>`__)"
msgstr ""
"PAG7936：连续设置曝光和增益时二者会互相覆盖（两者共用同一个手动模式，且回读寄存器滞后一帧）；驱动现在仅在进入手动模式时初始化手动寄存器，并且只写入正在设置的那个控制项。（\\"
" `e7a18c0a0 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e7a18c0a0>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:153
msgid ""
"PAG7936 and PS5520 BAYER capture on the OpenMV N6 failed with \"Failed to "
"initialize the CSI interface\" at any size other than full resolution, "
"because the N6 ISP cannot rescale raw Bayer. The sensors now run at a native"
" mode matching the requested size for BAYER (PS5520: VGA, HD, SXGA-M, FHD, "
"QHD, WQXGA2; QVGA has no native mode and is unsupported). (`fe6790055 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/fe6790055>`__, `b7622b245 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b7622b245>`__)"
msgstr ""
"在 OpenMV N6 上，PAG7936 和 PS5520 的 BAYER 采集在全分辨率以外的任何尺寸下都会以“Failed to "
"initialize the CSI interface”失败，因为 N6 的 ISP 无法对原始 Bayer "
"数据进行缩放。这些传感器现在会以与所请求尺寸匹配的原生模式运行 BAYER "
"采集（PS5520：VGA、HD、SXGA-M、FHD、QHD、WQXGA2；QVGA 没有原生模式，因此不受支持）。（\\ `fe6790055 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/fe6790055>`__\\ 、\\ `b7622b245 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b7622b245>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:161
msgid "Image encoding and saving:"
msgstr "图像编码与保存："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:163
msgid ""
"Software JPEG encoder: output-buffer overflow was always fatal because the "
"realloc path was disabled; it now grows the buffer (by half its size at a "
"time) when it owns it, falls back cleanly when memory runs out, and trims "
"the result. ``jpeg_write`` / ``mjpeg_write`` no longer write the buffer out "
"after a failed encode. (`28e1110be "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/28e1110be>`__)"
msgstr ""
"软件 JPEG 编码器：由于 realloc "
"路径被禁用，输出缓冲区溢出以前总是致命错误；现在当编码器拥有该缓冲区时会将其增大（每次增大一半），在内存耗尽时干净地回退，并裁剪结果。\\ "
"``jpeg_write`` / ``mjpeg_write`` 在编码失败后不再写出缓冲区。（\\ `28e1110be "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/28e1110be>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:169
msgid ""
"Hardware JPEG encoders (STM32): overflow returned a partially encoded image "
"with the allocation size, producing truncated files with no EOI marker (e.g."
" a 5 MP capture at quality 100 with a blank lower half). They now report "
"overflow, free the buffer on failure, and trim it on success. (`22ce9619c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/22ce9619c>`__)"
msgstr ""
"硬件 JPEG 编码器（STM32）：溢出时会返回一张只编码了一部分的图像并附带分配大小，产生没有 EOI 标记的截断文件（例如以质量 100 拍摄 5"
" MP 图像时下半部分为空白）。现在它们会报告溢出，失败时释放缓冲区，成功时裁剪缓冲区。（\\ `22ce9619c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/22ce9619c>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:174
msgid ""
"The VC8000 encoder silently produced 4:2:0 chroma for every request; "
"non-4:2:0 subsampling now falls back to the HW codec that supports it. "
"(`71f2be7f2 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/71f2be7f2>`__)"
msgstr ""
"VC8000 编码器以前会对每个请求都静默输出 4:2:0 色度；非 4:2:0 的子采样现在会回退到支持它的硬件编解码器。（\\ `71f2be7f2"
" <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/71f2be7f2>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:177
msgid ""
":meth:`image.Image.save` of a PNG image as ``.jpg`` wrote up to 1 MB of "
"uninitialized heap, and of a JPEG image as ``.png`` wrote an empty file. "
"Both now raise; an image already in the target format is still copied as-is."
" (`6c1fdf822 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/6c1fdf822>`__)"
msgstr ""
"用 :meth:`image.Image.save` 将 PNG 图像保存为 ``.jpg`` 会写出多达 1 MB 未初始化的堆内存，将 JPEG "
"图像保存为 ``.png`` 则会写出一个空文件。两者现在都会引发异常；已经是目标格式的图像仍会原样复制。（\\ `6c1fdf822 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/6c1fdf822>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:181
msgid ""
"``png_write`` now checks the compressor's return value and compresses before"
" creating the file, so a failure no longer leaves an empty file behind. "
"(`557f52d66 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/557f52d66>`__)"
msgstr ""
"``png_write`` 现在会检查压缩器的返回值，并在创建文件之前先进行压缩，因此失败时不再留下空文件。（\\ `557f52d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/557f52d66>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:185
msgid "Image module:"
msgstr "图像模块："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:187
msgid ""
":meth:`image.Image.get_pixel` with ``rgbtuple=True`` on BAYER and YUV images"
" wrote the converted pixel past a stack local at a caller-controlled offset."
" (`13f2a17b6 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/13f2a17b6>`__)"
msgstr ""
"在 BAYER 和 YUV 图像上以 ``rgbtuple=True`` 调用 :meth:`image.Image.get_pixel` "
"时，会把转换后的像素写到栈局部变量之外由调用方控制的偏移处。（\\ `13f2a17b6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/13f2a17b6>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:190
msgid ""
":meth:`gif.Gif.add_frame` dropped an unreachable Bayer/YUV conversion "
"branch; only GRAYSCALE and RGB565 images are accepted, as the Python API "
"already enforced. (`f20d99d96 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f20d99d96>`__)"
msgstr ""
":meth:`gif.Gif.add_frame` 移除了一个不可达的 Bayer/YUV 转换分支；只接受 GRAYSCALE 和 RGB565 "
"图像，这一点 Python API 原本就已强制执行。（\\ `f20d99d96 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f20d99d96>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:195
msgid "Protocol:"
msgstr "协议："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:197
msgid ""
"Registering a dynamic channel with every slot already in use caused an out-"
"of-bounds write; the channel ID is now checked first, and the reserved "
"channel IDs are statically asserted to fit the channel table. (`68f635d1f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/68f635d1f>`__)"
msgstr ""
"在所有槽位都已被占用时注册动态通道会导致越界写入；现在会先检查通道 ID，并通过静态断言确保保留的通道 ID 能放入通道表。（\\ `68f635d1f"
" <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/68f635d1f>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:201
msgid ""
"Dynamic channel objects survived a soft reset in root pointers, so the GC "
"kept scanning stale heap blocks from the previous run; the table is now "
"cleared on init. (`ef0ebb03b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/ef0ebb03b>`__, `e23641145 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e23641145>`__)"
msgstr ""
"动态通道对象在软复位后仍保留在根指针中，导致 GC 持续扫描上一次运行遗留的过期堆块；现在该表会在初始化时被清空。（\\ `ef0ebb03b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/ef0ebb03b>`__\\ 、\\ `e23641145 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/e23641145>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:207
msgid "Ports:"
msgstr "移植："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:209
msgid ""
"i.MX RT: added the missing CAN and Encoder de-initialization on soft reset. "
"(`7cb9d3dc2 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7cb9d3dc2>`__)"
msgstr ""
"i.MX RT：补上了软复位时缺失的 CAN 和 Encoder 反初始化。（\\ `7cb9d3dc2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7cb9d3dc2>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:214
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "硬件与开发板支持"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:216
msgid ""
"**OpenMV N6** — CAN is now enabled (:class:`machine.CAN`). (`294f0febd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/294f0febd>`__, `91e1c9573 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/91e1c9573>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV N6** —— 现已启用 CAN（\\ :class:`machine.CAN`\\ ）。（\\ `294f0febd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/294f0febd>`__\\ 、\\ `91e1c9573 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/91e1c9573>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:219
msgid ""
"**OpenMV AE3** — the ``sdcard`` SPI driver is frozen in for the microSD "
"socket on the :doc:`AE3 Battery Shield </openmvcam/shields/ae3-battery-"
"shield>`. (`a258f4814 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a258f4814>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV AE3** —— 为 :doc:`AE3 电池扩展板 </openmvcam/shields/ae3-battery-shield>`"
" 上的 microSD 插座固化了 ``sdcard`` SPI 驱动。（\\ `a258f4814 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a258f4814>`__\\ ）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:223
msgid ""
"**OpenMV RT1062** — ``lora-sx126x`` / ``lora-sync`` / ``lora-async`` frozen "
"in (see New features)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV RT1062** —— 固化了 ``lora-sx126x`` / ``lora-sync`` / ``lora-async``\\ "
"（参见“新功能”）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:225
msgid ""
"**FLIR Lepton 3.1R / UW** — recognized by the Lepton driver on all Lepton-"
"capable boards."
msgstr "**FLIR Lepton 3.1R / UW** —— 在所有支持 Lepton 的开发板上均可被 Lepton 驱动识别。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:227
msgid ""
"**PAG7936** — safe-shutdown halt, runtime interface selection, exposure/gain"
" fix, and BAYER capture on the N6."
msgstr "**PAG7936** —— 安全关机停止、运行时接口选择、曝光/增益修复，以及 N6 上的 BAYER 采集。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:229
msgid "**PS5520** — BAYER capture on the N6 at native sizes."
msgstr "**PS5520** —— N6 上以原生尺寸进行 BAYER 采集。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:230
msgid "**Simulator (MPS2_AN500)** — networking."
msgstr "**模拟器（MPS2_AN500）** —— 网络支持。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:231
msgid ""
"**All boards** — the ``sensor`` compatibility module is frozen into every "
"board's manifest."
msgstr "**所有开发板** —— ``sensor`` 兼容模块已固化进每块开发板的清单中。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:237
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "破坏性 API 变更"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:239
msgid ""
"v5.0.1 introduces **no breaking changes to the** :mod:`csi` **or** "
":mod:`image` **APIs**. Scripts that ran on v5.0.0 run unchanged, with the "
"following behavior changes."
msgstr ""
"v5.0.1 **没有对** :mod:`csi` **或** :mod:`image` **API 引入任何破坏性变更**\\ 。在 v5.0.0 "
"上运行的脚本无需修改即可继续运行，但有以下几处行为变更。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:246
msgid "``sensor`` module *(behavior)*"
msgstr "``sensor`` 模块 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:248
msgid ""
"The native ``sensor`` module (``modules/py_csi.c``) was removed and replaced"
" by a frozen Python module that implements the same API on top of "
":mod:`csi`. See :mod:`sensor`."
msgstr ""
"原生的 ``sensor`` 模块（\\ ``modules/py_csi.c``\\ ）已被移除，取而代之的是一个在 :mod:`csi` "
"之上实现相同 API 的固化 Python 模块。参见 :mod:`sensor`\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:252
msgid ""
"*Commit:* `5e3d40631 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/5e3d40631>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `5e3d40631 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/5e3d40631>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:254
msgid ""
"``import sensor`` prints ``WARNING: The sensor module is deprecated and will"
" be removed in a future release. Please use the csi module instead.`` to the"
" terminal."
msgstr ""
"``import sensor`` 会在终端打印 ``WARNING: The sensor module is deprecated and will"
" be removed in a future release. Please use the csi module instead.``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:257
msgid ""
"The hidden :class:`csi.CSI` object is created on import, so a missing camera"
" now raises at ``import sensor`` rather than at ``sensor.reset()``."
msgstr ""
"隐藏的 :class:`csi.CSI` 对象会在导入时创建，因此缺少摄像头时现在会在 ``import sensor`` 处报错，而不是在 "
"``sensor.reset()`` 处。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:259
msgid ""
"These functions now raise ``OSError`` because :mod:`csi` has no equivalent: "
"``get_fb()``, ``alloc_extra_fb()``, ``dealloc_extra_fb()``, "
"``set_auto_rotation()``, ``get_auto_rotation()``, ``disable_delays()``, "
"``disable_full_flush()``. (The two ``*_extra_fb`` functions already raised "
"in v5.0.0.) Use ``csi.CSI(delays=False)`` / ``csi.CSI(fflush=False)`` for "
"the last two."
msgstr ""
"以下函数现在会引发 ``OSError``\\ ，因为 :mod:`csi` 中没有对应功能：\\ ``get_fb()``\\ 、\\ "
"``alloc_extra_fb()``\\ 、\\ ``dealloc_extra_fb()``\\ 、\\ "
"``set_auto_rotation()``\\ 、\\ ``get_auto_rotation()``\\ 、\\ "
"``disable_delays()``\\ 、\\ ``disable_full_flush()``\\ 。（两个 ``*_extra_fb`` "
"函数在 v5.0.0 中就已经会引发异常。）对于最后两个，请使用 ``csi.CSI(delays=False)`` / "
"``csi.CSI(fflush=False)``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:265
msgid ""
"Framesizes that :mod:`csi` does not export (``QQCIF``, ``QQSIF``, "
"``QQQQVGA``, ``HQQQQVGA``, ``HQQQVGA``, ``HQQVGA``, ``B64X32``, ``B64X64``, "
"``B128X64``, ``B128X128``, ``B160X160``, ``B320X320``, ``LCD``, ``QQVGA2``) "
"are now ``(w, h)`` tuples passed through as custom resolutions. "
"``get_framesize()`` returns the tuple that was set while the camera is still"
" at that size, so equality checks against the constants keep working."
msgstr ""
":mod:`csi` 未导出的 framesize（\\ ``QQCIF``\\ 、\\ ``QQSIF``\\ 、\\ ``QQQQVGA``\\ "
"、\\ ``HQQQQVGA``\\ 、\\ ``HQQQVGA``\\ 、\\ ``HQQVGA``\\ 、\\ ``B64X32``\\ 、\\ "
"``B64X64``\\ 、\\ ``B128X64``\\ 、\\ ``B128X128``\\ 、\\ ``B160X160``\\ 、\\ "
"``B320X320``\\ 、\\ ``LCD``\\ 、\\ ``QQVGA2``\\ ）现在是作为自定义分辨率透传的 ``(w, h)`` "
"元组。当摄像头仍处于所设置的尺寸时，\\ ``get_framesize()`` 会返回所设置的那个元组，因此与常量的相等比较继续有效。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:271
msgid "``ioctl()`` forwards at most four arguments after the request."
msgstr "``ioctl()`` 在请求之后最多转发四个参数。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:272
msgid ""
"``sleep()`` / ``shutdown()`` raise ``OSError`` on failure as before (the "
":mod:`csi` ``RuntimeError`` is translated)."
msgstr ""
"``sleep()`` / ``shutdown()`` 失败时仍像以前一样引发 ``OSError``\\ （\\ :mod:`csi` 的 "
"``RuntimeError`` 会被转换）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:275
msgid ""
"Migrate to :mod:`csi` — see the :ref:`v5.0.0 migration table <v5_0_0_s1>`."
msgstr "请迁移到 :mod:`csi` —— 参见 :ref:`v5.0.0 迁移表 <v5_0_0_s1>`\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:280
msgid "Frame-buffer image loading *(behavior)*"
msgstr "帧缓冲区图像加载 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:282
msgid ""
"Functions that load an image into the frame buffer — :class:`image.Image` "
"with ``copy_to_fb=True``, :meth:`image.Image.copy` / "
":meth:`image.Image.scale` and the ``to_*`` conversions with "
"``copy_to_fb=True``, :meth:`image.ImageIO.read`, :func:`fir.snapshot` and "
":func:`tof.snapshot` with ``copy_to_fb=True`` — used to push the new image "
"to the IDE preview immediately, so anything drawn on the returned image was "
"never seen. They now mark the frame buffer as pending and flush it, with "
"everything drawn on it, right before the next image overwrites it — the same"
" behavior as :meth:`csi.CSI.snapshot`."
msgstr ""
"将图像加载到帧缓冲区的函数——带 ``copy_to_fb=True`` 的 :class:`image.Image`\\ 、带 "
"``copy_to_fb=True`` 的 :meth:`image.Image.copy` / :meth:`image.Image.scale` 及"
" ``to_*`` 转换、\\ :meth:`image.ImageIO.read`\\ ，以及带 ``copy_to_fb=True`` 的 "
":func:`fir.snapshot` 和 :func:`tof.snapshot`\\ ——以前会立即把新图像推送到 IDE "
"预览，因此绘制在返回图像上的任何内容都永远看不到。它们现在会把帧缓冲区标记为待刷出，并在下一张图像覆盖它之前，连同绘制在其上的全部内容一起刷出——与 "
":meth:`csi.CSI.snapshot` 的行为相同。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:292
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `87b6db5ee "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/87b6db5ee>`__, `7b1a35c2f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7b1a35c2f>`__, `f773c740d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f773c740d>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `87b6db5ee <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/87b6db5ee>`__\\ "
"、\\ `7b1a35c2f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7b1a35c2f>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`f773c740d <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f773c740d>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:296
msgid ""
"Loops that read a stream of images need no change and now show their "
"drawing. A script that loads a **single** image and stops must flush it "
"explicitly:"
msgstr "读取图像流的循环无需任何修改，并且现在能显示其绘制的内容。而只加载\\ **单张**\\ 图像便结束的脚本必须显式地刷出它："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:309
msgid "ML library *(behavior)*"
msgstr "机器学习库 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:311
msgid ""
"Only affects code that subclasses or copies the shipped post-processors. "
":class:`~ml.postprocessing.ultralytics.YoloV8` now transposes the model "
"output after thresholding so surviving detections are stored one **row** per"
" box (``bb[:, 4:]``), matching the Darknet and Edge Impulse post-processors,"
" instead of one column per box (``bb[4:, :]``). The public ``((x, y, w, h), "
"score)`` results are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"仅影响继承或复制了随附后处理器的代码。\\ :class:`~ml.postprocessing.ultralytics.YoloV8` "
"现在会在阈值筛选后转置模型输出，使保留下来的检测结果按每个框一\\ **行**\\ 存储（\\ ``bb[:, 4:]``\\ ），与 Darknet "
"和 Edge Impulse 后处理器一致，而不再是每个框一列（\\ ``bb[4:, :]``\\ ）。公开的 ``((x, y, w, h), "
"score)`` 结果保持不变。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:318
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `c45f99cad "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c45f99cad>`__, `b5c7853f2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b5c7853f2>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `c45f99cad <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c45f99cad>`__\\ "
"、\\ `b5c7853f2 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b5c7853f2>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:324
msgid "``protocol`` module *(minor)*"
msgstr "``protocol`` 模块 *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:326
msgid ""
":func:`protocol.poll` is back. v5.0.0 removed it when the protocol task "
"moved to the timer; it returns as an explicit way to drive the task for "
"custom transports. Nothing else changed — scripts that never called it are "
"unaffected."
msgstr ""
":func:`protocol.poll` 回归了。v5.0.0 "
"在协议任务移至定时器时移除了它；现在它作为为自定义传输层显式驱动该任务的方式回归。其他一切均未改变——从未调用过它的脚本不受影响。"

